        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leni Riefenstahl, Annie Sundberg, Ricki Stern, Naomi Wolf, Karl Attenberger\n- Products: Triumph of the Will, The End of America\n- Topics: propaganda films, documentary films, book adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1935, \"Triumph of the Will\" was released as a German propaganda film.\n- Leni Riefenstahl directed, produced, edited, and co-wrote the 1935 film \"Triumph of the Will.\"\n- Karl Attenberger worked with Leni Riefenstahl on the 1935 propaganda documentary \"Triumph of the Will.\"\n- In 2007, Naomi Wolf published the book on which \"The End of America\" was adapted.\n- In 2008, \"The End of America\" was released as a documentary film directed by Annie Sundberg and Ricki Stern.",
